# Agent runtime journals. `orch` writes one directory per requirement here while
# it works, and the `note` table already holds the same text — so a checkout was
# accumulating a second copy that nothing read and every clone carried. Twenty-nine
# files across four requirements before they were removed. `comment-moves.md` is
# ours, not the fleet's, and is tracked.
docs/journal/*/
